            <string name="Source"><![CDATA[--!strict

-- Data definitions statis (single source of truth untuk item/quest/lesson).
-- Referensi tipe: shared/types/Definitions.lua (ItemDef),
-- shared/types/QuestDefTypes.lua (QuestDef).

